NOTE ON DATA

The MIT licence above covers the SOFTWARE only (index.html and the scripts
that build it).

The DATA files under data/ are licensed separately under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

  * data/cims_peaklist.csv  — molecular formulas extracted from the published
    literature, with citations. Elemental compositions are facts and are not
    themselves copyrightable; the compilation is released under CC BY 4.0.

  * data/cims_ionlist.csv   — measured peak lists contributed by named
    researchers. Each record carries its contributor. Redistribution must
    preserve that attribution. Unpublished contributions are NOT included in
    the public build.

If you use this tool or its data in a publication, please cite the tool and
the original papers listed in the `reference` column.
